OL,3,GNEWSAWoman grieving death of sister
OL,4,Awins #10k-a-month for 30 years prize
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who was grieving the death of
OL,7,Fher sister said she asked her for "a
OL,8,Fsign" during a difficult night and woke
OL,9,Fup to find she had won a life-changing
OL,10,Flottery prize.
OL,12,FAmanda Hampton, 51, from Cardiff, said
OL,13,Fshe initially dismissed the email about
OL,14,Fthe win before discovering her family
OL,15,Fsyndicate had won #10,000 every month
OL,16,Ffor the next 30 years.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,437,430,260,140,0,100
