OL,3,GNEWSAWoman grieving death of sister
OL,4,Awins #10k-a-month for 30 years prize
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe win for the syndicate, which also
OL,7,Fincluded Amanda's brother Gareth, her
OL,8,Fex-husband, Matthew, and close family
OL,9,Ffriend Louise, came on 3 February 2025,
OL,10,Fless than a year after Amanda and
OL,11,FGareth's sister Michelle died.
OL,13,F"We know Michelle would be thrilled
OL,14,Fthat the family is secure and that
OL,15,Fwe're looking after the children,"
OL,16,FAmanda said.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
